{"name":"Escalant","status":"ok","title":"Escalant","pageId":23271,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Escalant</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p148_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p148-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lapendrar\" title=\"Lapendrar\">Lapendrar</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Large City</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S:CG-p40-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p169_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p169-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"demonym\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Demonym</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Escalanter</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>  </td><td> 82%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">Gnoll</a>  </td><td> 5%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">Half-elf</a>  </td><td> 5%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" title=\"Half-orc\">Half-orc</a>  </td><td> 5%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halfling</a>  </td><td> 2% </td></tr><tr><td> Other </td><td> 1% </td></tr></tbody></table><small>As of <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a></small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alignment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alignments</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"alignment-grid\" style=\"caption-side:top;\">  <tbody><tr>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_good\" title=\"Lawful good\">LG</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral_good\" title=\"Neutral good\">NG</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_good\" title=\"Chaotic good\">CG</a></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_neutral\" title=\"Lawful neutral\">LN</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral\" title=\"Neutral\">N</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-on\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_neutral\" title=\"Chaotic neutral\">CN</a></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_evil\" title=\"Lawful evil\">LE</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-on\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral_evil\" title=\"Neutral evil\">NE</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_evil\" title=\"Chaotic evil\">CE</a></td>  </tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">20,000<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p8_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p8-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>note 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357&#160;DR</a><br>28,728&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Escalant\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Escalant\">Inhabitants of  Escalant</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Escalant\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Locations in Escalant\">Locations in  Escalant</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Escalant (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9Fc2NhbGFudD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Organizations in  Escalant</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Escalant</b> was a coastal city situated on the mouth of the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Lapendrar\" title=\"River Lapendrar\">River Lapendrar</a> located within the <a href=\"/wiki/Lapendrar\" title=\"Lapendrar\">tharch of same name</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/East_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"East Faerûn\">eastern</a> nation of <a href=\"/wiki/Thay\" title=\"Thay\">Thay</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3emap_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3emap-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> While it was previously independent and allied with other port city-states in the region, Escalant was intermittently under Thayan control during the 350 years leading up to the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-OE-p8_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p8-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>It served as one of the nation's most important sea ports, trailing the great metropolis of <a href=\"/wiki/Bezantur\" title=\"Bezantur\">Bezantur</a> in terms of influence.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p169_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p169-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was quite prosperous and its docks were regularly visited with ships from <a href=\"/wiki/Chessenta\" title=\"Chessenta\">Chessenta</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorand</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Turmish\" title=\"Turmish\">Turmish</a> and beyond.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S:CG-p40-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Defense\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defense</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Escalant?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>While Escalant was originally built within the confines of a strong wall, the sprawling city grew well outward and it was left in near ruins.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p169_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p169-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The streets of the city were lined with warehouses, apartment buildings and shipping facilities that extended over a mile (1.6 km) inland from the docks.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S:CG-p40-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Escalant?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For years, Escalant maintained a loose association with <a href=\"/wiki/Delthuntle\" title=\"Delthuntle\">Delthuntle</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Laothkund\" title=\"Laothkund\">Laothkund</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lasdur\" title=\"Lasdur\">Lasdur</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Murbant\" title=\"Murbant\">Murbant</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Nethra\" title=\"Nethra\">Nethra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Taskaunt\" title=\"Taskaunt\">Taskaunt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Teth\" title=\"Teth\">Teth</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Thasselen\" title=\"Thasselen\">Thasselen</a>, an alliance known as the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Cities of the North Coast (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2l0aWVzX29mX3RoZV9Ob3J0aF9Db2FzdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cities of the North Coast</span>. The cities formed this union to ensure their mutual defense and improve trade.<sup id=\"cite_ref-DotRW-p9_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DotRW-p9-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>While Escalant was under the control of Thay it was seldom interfered with by the ruling tharchion, <a href=\"/wiki/Hezass_Nymar\" title=\"Hezass Nymar\">Hezass Nymar</a>, provided the city's taxes were collected in a timely manner.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p169_3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p169-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p169_3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p169-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defense\">Defense</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Defense\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Escalant?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Defense\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Escalant was defended by a militia comprising troops hired as mercenaries.<sup id=\"cite_ref-DotRW-p60_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DotRW-p60-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> These forces were supplemented by human and <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">gnoll</a> legionnaires.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p169_3-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p169-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Escalant?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Escalant was first settled by colonists from the realm of <a href=\"/wiki/Unther\" title=\"Unther\">Unther</a> around the year <a href=\"/wiki/400_DR\" title=\"400 DR\">400 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p169_3-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p169-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The citizens declared their independence from the Old Empire in <a href=\"/wiki/625_DR\" title=\"625 DR\">625 DR</a> and lived proud and free for over 300 years. However in <a href=\"/wiki/934_DR\" title=\"934 DR\">934 DR</a>, forces from Thay marched upon the city and demanded tribute as they extended their borders west towards <a href=\"/wiki/Wizards%27_Reach\" title=\"Wizards' Reach\">Wizards' Reach</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S:CG-p40-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Sometime during its history, Escalant had at one point been completely burned to the ground.<sup id=\"cite_ref-DotRW-p23_9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DotRW-p23-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>While influence from Thay continued into the 14<sup>th</sup> century, the outbreak of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Great Inner Sea plague (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR3JlYXRfSW5uZXJfU2VhX3BsYWd1ZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Great Inner Sea plague</span> of <a href=\"/wiki/1320_DR\" title=\"1320 DR\">1320 DR</a> led to great social turmoil and Escalant stood defiant and maintained their independence. While they held strong for over a generation, the Red Wizards marched on the city once again in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a>, allied with beings from the <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Plane_of_Fire\" title=\"Elemental Plane of Fire\">Elemental Plane of Fire</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Salamander_War\" title=\"Salamander War\">Salamander War</a> was catastrophic to the cities of the coast. While Escalant survived the onslaught, they eventually surrendered to the <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Wizards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Red Wizards\">Red Wizards</a> and the extra-planar <a href=\"/wiki/Salamander\" title=\"Salamander\">salamanders</a> and the city once again fell under Thayan dominion.<sup id=\"cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S:CG-p40-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Escalant?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i>  <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Escalant?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notes\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<small><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">On p. 9 of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Dreams_of_the_Red_Wizards\" title=\"Dreams of the Red Wizards\">Dreams of the Red Wizards</a></i>, the population of Escalant is given as around 20,000, but on p. 23, the population is given as 30,000. The figure of 20,000 has been used in this article since this figure is used elsewhere in sources set in the same year, such as <i><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires\" title=\"Old Empires\">Old Empires</a></i>, p. 8.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></small>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Escalant?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-UE-p148-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-UE-p148_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Baker\" title=\"Richard Baker\">Richard Baker</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Matt_Forbeck\" title=\"Matt Forbeck\">Matt Forbeck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>&#160;(May 2003). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Unapproachable East (sourcebook)\">Unapproachable East</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 148. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-2881-6\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-2881-6\">0-7869-2881-6</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-S:CG-p40-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-2\">2.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-3\">2.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-S:CG-p40_2-4\">2.4</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anthony_Pryor\" title=\"Anthony Pryor\">Anthony Pryor